/* Interface style Original: its sheets as one, which UiLayout.Configure adds to every screen root (and every element there
   that carries its own sheets), after the screen's own sheets. UI Toolkit lets a sheet attached lower in the tree win over
   the panel's theme whatever the selectors' specificity, so through the theme alone (GoF2Theme.tss) the Original rules lost
   every property the screens' sheets also set (sizes, positions, images). Every rule in them is under .ui-style-original,
   so they change nothing in the Remake style. */
@import url("project://database/Assets/UI/GoF2Original.uss");
@import url("project://database/Assets/UI/Original/OriginalMainMenu.uss");
@import url("project://database/Assets/UI/Original/OriginalStation.uss");
@import url("project://database/Assets/UI/Original/OriginalHangar.uss");
@import url("project://database/Assets/UI/Original/OriginalFlight.uss");
